        <canEscalate>false</canEscalate>
        <description>Generate and send a follow-up nudge email for a lead who has not responded to a previous outreach from Nova.</description>
        <developerName>sales_sdr_agent_FollowUpOutreach_1Tec1000001LJDaCAO_16jc10000003oY9</developerName>
        <genAiPluginInstructions>
            <description>Purpose: Generate a follow-up nudge for a lead who has not responded to the previous outreach. 
The LNA Nova - Follow-up Outreach action handles all logic and returns the complete email including subject and body.

Call the action with:
- InputLeadId = currentRecordId
- InputEmailBody = emailBody
- InputIsFinalMessage = isFinalMessage

Do not call any additional actions.</description>
            <developerName>Instruction1</developerName>
            <language xsi:nil="true"/>
            <masterLabel>Instruction1</masterLabel>
            <sortOrder>0</sortOrder>
        </genAiPluginInstructions>
        <genAiPluginInstructions>
            <description>Guardrails:
- Never share product prices
- Never offer specific products, services, or tiers
- Never recommend specific days or times for a meeting
- Never fabricate company-specific data or statistics
- If the flow action returns an error or empty result, do not attempt to generate an email yourself. Create a Task for the Lead Owner and stop.</description>
            <developerName>Instruction2</developerName>
            <language xsi:nil="true"/>
            <masterLabel>Instruction2</masterLabel>
            <sortOrder>1</sortOrder>
