    <localTopics>
        <fullName>sales_sdr_agent_ManageOptOut_1Tec1000001LJDaCAO_16jc10000003oY9</fullName>
        <canEscalate>false</canEscalate>
        <description>Handles lead replies that are negative, irrelevant, or spam. This topic covers three categories: (1) SPAM — the reply is completely unrelated to Statista&apos;s outreach, contains jibberish, promotes unrelated products or services, or makes no sense in the context of a business conversation about data and statistics (e.g. &quot;buy cheap watches&quot;, random characters, unrelated sales pitches). (2) NOT INTERESTED — the lead declines or rejects the outreach (e.g. &quot;not interested&quot;, &quot;no thanks&quot;, &quot;we already have a solution&quot;). (3) OPT-OUT — the lead explicitly asks to stop receiving emails (e.g. &quot;remove me&quot;, &quot;unsubscribe&quot;, &quot;stop emailing me&quot;). After classifying and responding, updates the Lead record to unqualify the lead.</description>
        <developerName>sales_sdr_agent_ManageOptOut_1Tec1000001LJDaCAO_16jc10000003oY9</developerName>
        <genAiPluginInstructions>
            <description>Purpose: Respond to leads who have replied with a negative, irrelevant, or spam response. Invoke the &apos;LNA Nova - Manage Opt-Out&apos; flow action, Pass the Lead&apos;s record ID as InputLeadId, and the lead&apos;s reply as emailBody. The flow classifies the reply (SPAM / NOT_INTERESTED / OPT_OUT), generates a brief confirmation response, updates the Lead record to unqualify it with the correct reason and opt-out flag, logs the summary to LeadDescription__c, and returns the complete email including subject and body. Do not call any additional actions or update any records yourself.</description>
            <developerName>Instruction1</developerName>
            <language xsi:nil="true"/>
            <masterLabel>Instruction1</masterLabel>
            <sortOrder>0</sortOrder>
        </genAiPluginInstructions>
        <genAiPluginInstructions>
            <description>Guardrails:
- Never try to re-engage or change the lead&apos;s mind — their decision is final
- Never offer a meeting, suggest &quot;reaching out later&quot;, or propose alternatives
- Never include a sign-off, closing, or signature — the platform handles this
- Never share product prices, services, or company details in the response
- If the &apos;LNA Nova - Manage Opt-Out&apos; flow returns an error or empty result, do not retry. Stop and do not send a reply. Do not attempt to generate a reply yourself.</description>
            <developerName>Instruction2</developerName>
            <language xsi:nil="true"/>
            <masterLabel>Instruction2</masterLabel>
            <sortOrder>1</sortOrder>
        </genAiPluginInstructions>
